  "text_md": "**Dr. P. MARIAYYAH** DEPARTMENT OF PHYSICAL EDUCATION ***l^hi,*** DIRECTOR, PROFESSOR & HEAD BHARATHIDASAN UNIVERSITY TIRUCHIRAPPALI - 620 024.\n\n# CERTIFICATE\n\nThis is to certify the thesis entitled \"EFFECT OF PHYSICAL AND COMBINATION OF PHYSICAL AND YOGIC EXERCISES ON PERFORMANCE AND PERFORMANCE RELATED FACTORS OF BASKETBALL PLAYERS\" submitted by M.M.G. HARI HARA RAMACHANDHIRAN for the award of the degree of Doctor of Philosophy in the Department of Physical Education, Bharathidasan University, Tiruchirappalli, is a bonafide record of research work carried out under my guidance and supervision. It is further certified that to the best of my knowedge the work reported here does not form part of any other thesis or dissertation for the award of any other degree or diploma.\n\nPlace: Tiruchirappalli Date: ) 5-o5-oS (Dr. P. MARIAYYAH)\n\n*m.* ?. PARIAYYAf:. n»A= **PROFESSOR AND HEAD,**\n**f-BTvA/Nra*TjC(G«»C-ESPARRIENT OF PHYSICAL EDUCATICj** **EHARATHIDASAN UNIVERSITY^** **?IRUCHIRAPPALU - 620 0?!6^** **Qu. K. CHANDRASEKARAK.LTi.i^^** LECTURER ^ V\\e^d '/<:. ©2PARTOENT **OF PHYSICAL EDUCAYEC!** **BHARATHIDASAN UNIVERSIHj** TIRUCHIRAPALLI-620Q2iC:,\n",
